window.products.push({"id":627009,"name":"Butane Torch, ibforcty Refillable Culinary Cooking Torch Kitchen Blow Torch Lighter with Safety Lock Adjustable and Lock Flame (Butane Gas not Include","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Es9JrMU2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Stainless Steel 【Professional Cooking Torch】Ideal for BBQ, creating the finishing touch to a variety of dishes, desserts such as caramelizing sugar toppings, browning meringues and crisping joints of meat. Our amazing torch will let you transform simple recipes into dishes that look & taste as if they came from a professional chef's kitchen. Piezo press ignition allows for fast, safe, immediate lighting. 【Adjustable Flame to Meet Your Demands】This culinary butane blow torch comes with a gas flow regulator dial, which makes it easily adjust flame from 0 to 2370°F/1300°C and create a continuous flame up to 6 inches long. Press the button to light fire, slide the button to lock at the same time , then it will keep fire, slide the button to On , the flame goes out. 【Safe & Durable Blow Torch】Coming with unique security lock, this cooking torch prevents against accidental ignition even in kids' hand. The built in finger guard protects you from burns and extreme heat while torching and browning; torch is constructed with zinc alloy titanium gold metal to ensure ergonomic comfort. 【Refillable gift kitchen torch】Fit for all butane gas, our flame lighter can be refilled easily and running long time. Your torch arrives in a gift box, so there’s no need for wrapping. Note: the butane canister with the LONG UNIVERSAL REFILL TIP needed. 【Multi-functional】Portable design makes it perfect for indoor home and outdoor camping cooking activities, it's great for sous vide, flambe, searing meat, bar cocktails, lighting a fire, cigars, dabs, BBQ grills, for camping, and for craft and artist work such as art resin. It is also great for soldering, brazing jewellery or metal.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Es9JrMU2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ibforcty","source_asin":"B099X3NHBJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-627009","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099X3NHBJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099X3NHBJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
