window.products.push({"id":627101,"name":"MAISONPEX Double Layer Large Bamboo Bread Box for Kitchen Countertop, Cutting Board, and Stainless Steel Bread Knife, Large Capacity Bread Storage Con","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710E+8LVPfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STURDY, STYLISH & EASY ASSEMBLY, It’s an ideal bread storage box to store bread, cake and baked goods inside your kitchen countertop bread keeper that are made of natural bamboo，also perfect for storing bagels, tortillas, hot dog buns, burger rolls to keep them appetizing. its farmhouse chic style will meet most decoration needs. It only takes a few minutes for you to assemble this large bread box. A great gift for friends and family especially for bread and baker lovers for festival. LARGE BOX & CUTTING BOARD & BREAD KNIFE Combination, Bread box is made of 100% natural bamboo,which is solid, with a large cutting board and a high quality stainless steel bread knife which stored under the box. Easy to find any time you need ,and you only need to pull it out to use . The 2 layers box is large enough to hold different sizes of bread, which will avoid effectively deformation of bread caused by extrusion. Also cutting board and knife are all included, more convenient for you. KEEP HOMEMADE BREADS FRESH FOR LONGER, As made of natural bamboo, our bread box ensures food safety, keeping bread and other baked goods fresh for up to 3 or 4 days. The gap from countertop to the bottom of breadbox and the gap behind backboard can keep the bread boxes away from the water and wall to ensure the bread to be fresh and delicious longer. Bread holder measures: 15.7\"L x 15\"W x 8.7\" H, and holds more than 2 loaves of bread, plus rolls, pastries and more. EASILY CHECK BREAD LEFT FOR KITCHEN COUNTERTOP, A clear window is on the each floor and allows for a clear inside view. This tell you whether you need to buy or bake more bread ,which also save your time and keep you more organized in daily life. The slotted arc edged bottom on both sides allow for gripping the bread box container more easily and avoid slipping. Moving your bread boxes will be more safe and convenient. MULTIFUNCTIONAL BREAD STORAGE BOX FOR KITCHEN : Besides bread and baked goods, you can also use our bamboo storing bread box to store jars or other kitchen supplies. On the box flat top, other things can also be placed. Thereby you will need such a useful storage box for your kitchen.Don’t miss it !If there is any problems or questions, pls feel free to contact to us, and we will reply and offer solutions within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710E+8LVPfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAISONPEX","source_asin":"B0BDR9YJDP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-627101","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDR9YJDP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDR9YJDP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
