window.products.push({"id":627170,"name":"Miele Classic C1 Pure Suction Bagged Canister Vacuum, Graphite Grey - Portable, Household","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hWP9f69CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Mile Classic C1 Pure Suction bagged canister vacuum cleaner is both powerful and lightweight. The combination pure suction floor head is ideal for cleaning hard floors and low-pile carpets and area rugs. Switch between 6 different suction power settings specific to the surface being cleaned, whether it's upholstery or flooring. Combining a genuine Mile Air Clean Filter Bag, Air Clean Filter and motor protection filter - you can be ensured that the room air is cleaner after vacuuming than before. Standard accessories include the SBD 285-3 Pure Suction Combination Floor head, Dusting Brush, Upholstery Tool, Crevice Tool, Air Clean Filter and Mile Original Air Clean Filter Bag Type GN. Mile vacuums have a 7-year manufacturer on motor and casing, and 1-year manufacturer on parts and labor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hWP9f69CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Miele","source_asin":"B07P97CD5T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-627170","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P97CD5T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P97CD5T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":627171,"name":"Teac SL-D80 Nostalgia CD Player with AM/FM Radio, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RME2E1R2L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description This TEAC Deluxe AM/FM Stereo Radio CD Player with Digital Clock is a modern system disguised in a retro silver design. Despite a cool 50s-diner look it's a fully up-to-date system with stereo tuner and top-loading CD player. Features: 20-track music memory system; shuffle play, play/pause, stop, music skip (up/down) functions; 4-digit LED display; rotary analog AM/FM stereo tuner; rotary volume control; headphone output; digital clock with wake to radio or CD and sleep to radio functions; and sleep timer. 7-3/16Hx11-7/16Wx7-1/16D\". Amazon.com Relive the era of sock hops and soda jerks with this classic Teac '50s-style stereo system. The SL-D80 combines a mid-20th-century aesthetic (witness the jukebox-like front panel and classic chrome highlights) with a modern touch (a top-loading CD player), letting listeners tap into their CD catalogues while fondly remembering when 45s were all the rage. The system also includes an analog AM/FM tuner with a rotary dial and a pair of integrated stereo speakers. It's the CD player that steals the show, however, as it not only plays your favorite tunes, but also offers 20-track programming and shuffle play functions, letting you create a custom soundtrack or mix up your selections depending on your mood. Though the SL-D80 offers stereo sound, listeners can opt instead to connect a pair of headphones through the 3.5 mm headphone jack for private listening. And thanks to the built-in digital clock--which comes with its own alarm--listeners can wake up in the morning to either the radio or the CD player. Additional features include a sleep timer with 30-, 60-, and 90-minute settings; a rotary volume control; and a four-digit LED display. So whether you need a good tabletop stereo for listening in your basement bar or you're a nostalgia nut that needs a reliable CD system, the SL-D80's blend of classic and contemporary is an ideal choice. The system measures 11.69 by 6.81 by 7.09 inches (W x H x D) and also comes in black, jade green, white, and red colors. What's in the Box SL-D80 stereo, user's manual.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RME2E1R2L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Teac","source_asin":"B0000UUR6M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-627171","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000UUR6M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000UUR6M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
