window.products.push({"id":627185,"name":"BioPEDIC Sleep Styles Pillow, King, White, 2 Count","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61m8EG1nO9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The BioPEDIC® Firm Density Pillow 2 Pack is constructed with a 1.5\" sateen gusseted sidewall to provide head cradling and shoulder support while helping to align the spine to a more natural sleeping position. These pillows feature Nanotex Coolest Comfort Technology built into the fabric that provides enhanced moisture wicking and breathability to help you you stay cool and comfortable all night. These pillows are filled with a luxurious SofLOFT® plush hypoallergenic fiber fill and feature super soft, 220 thread count polyester covers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61m8EG1nO9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BioPEDIC","source_asin":"B01F9IZIT0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-627185","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01F9IZIT0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01F9IZIT0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":627186,"name":"Rhinestone Automatic Soap & Gel Hand Sanitizer Dispenser – Touchless Motion Sensor (33.8oz) Tank – Wall Mounted Suitable for Homes, Schools & Airports","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pKoN6FniL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Washing Hands To Improve Hygiene Whichever facility you may run, it is always vital to make it possible for people to wash their hands and sanitize conveniently. An automatic soap and hand sanitizer comes in handy in such an instance to create this convenience and help people maintain high levels of hygiene. At Rhinestone, we share this concern. For this reason, we help you make this possible with our hand sanitizer dispenser. Fully Automated Automation is our main focus when it comes to designing this hand sanitizer gel dispenser. We make it possible for you and other users to access the dispenser's contents without having to touch the dispenser itself physically. Our motion sensor hand sanitizer dispenser only requires you to place your hand below the outlet, and it will release the soap or sanitizer into your hand automatically. This touchless sanitizer dispenser helps enhance the levels of hygiene wherever you deploy them by reducing the contact between people and the soap and sanitizer dispenser. Large Capacity A large capacity 33.8oz tank makes it possible to pour enough sanitizer or soap inside the wall mounted dispenser and have it serve a large number of people for an extended period. Compared to many other dispensers on the market, our Rhinestone motion sensor soap and hand sanitizer dispenser's capacity helps cut down the time that one would otherwise waste refilling the dispenser tank. Simple To Use We make the ease of use or primary focus for both the operator and the dispenser's end user. You will have an easy time refilling the sanitizer or soap each time you deplete it. Simply open up the tank and pour your target amount. Mounting the dispenser on the wall is also easy and will not require any special skills or equipment to accomplish. This wall mounted motion sensor soap and sanitizer dispenser is suitable for schools, airports, malls, and even homes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pKoN6FniL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rhinestone","source_asin":"B08MVDX3NQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-627186","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MVDX3NQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MVDX3NQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
