window.products.push({"id":627359,"name":"Extra Large-Chopping Blocks, Butcher Blocks, Cutting Boards - 2\" X 15\" X 22\" - End Grain hardwood with Bun Feet- Ambrosia Maple Walnut Cherry Cottonwo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NHJghu3IL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"---EVERY KITCHEN WANTS AN OLE GEORGE BUTCHER BLOCK--- -Click above on \" Ole George Butcher Blocks\" to see all offers -Ole George end grain butcher blocks are made from local hardwood trees and contain one or more of the following species; Cherry, Cottonwood, Hickory, Maple, and Walnut. -The \"end grain\" of these hardwoods creates a very durable chopping surface that's much easier on your knife than an edge grain block. -Ole George end grain butcher blocks are created to give you lifelong enjoyment to be handed down from generation to generation. -Ole George butcher blocks are hand-crafted in the Great Smoky Mountains, North Carolina by Ole George himself. -Each butcher block is individually created so that there are no two exactly alike. Your Ole George butcher block is uniquely yours.-Ole George butcher blocks make a beautiful and functional addition to your kitchen.-The 2” high bun feet allow you to move chopped items directly into a dish or bowl with no mess. -Ole George butcher block dimensions are approximate. The hand making process creates each butcher block with slightly different dimensions. -Ole George butcher blocks are created to withstand heavy use with any knife or meat clever. -To clean your Ole George butcher block, use warm water with a mild detergent or lemon or vinegar. We recommend that you clean your butcher block after each use. To remove stains, use salt and rub into the stain with a lemon. Baking soda will remove most odors -To restore your butcher block finish, use any food safe mineral oil. -Ole George is proud to offer a one-year guarantee and your butcher block may be returned for any reason for a full replacement. -Ole George butcher blocks are warranted for a full cash refund, with a return of your butcher block, for any reason for 30 days.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NHJghu3IL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OLE GEORGE BUTCHER BLOCKS","source_asin":"B084BWNVRJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-627359","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084BWNVRJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084BWNVRJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
