window.products.push({"id":627546,"name":"Pomodoro Technique Timer, Best Unique Small Desktop Digital Timer with Update Clear LCD,Beep/Flash Alarm,Strong Magnets for Zen Meditation,Break,Bbq,k","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61f39sRnvoL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Do not want to disturb the others? Timer could help you to work or learn high efficiency, time management or GTD need timer to control. However, If you are in office, library, classroom, silent night or somewhere and sometime else need quiet, the normal timer will effect the others. This flashing digital timer will be your ideal timer. When switch to mute mode, red led flashing and very small beep at the same time instead  of loud beep when time countdown finished. Could not see the digital number clearly? Upgrated LCD to avoid LCD ghosting, there is no shadows for the non-display digital number, so you could see our digital timer from different angles, And it’s very clear at any angle. Worry about the digital timer fall down from the fridge surface? Our digital timer use 3pcs strong magnets, do not worry about the falling. Enjoy your cooking! Unhappy with your purchase? We offer 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE. If you are not satisfied with your purchase, or There is transport damage for the flashing timer, Please do not hesitate to let us know, we will replace it or 100% refund your money! Operation 1. Put in an AAA battery.  2. Press the “M” or “S” button to set the required time, then press “ST/SP” button to start timing.  3. The alarm will last for 60 seconds until you press any button to stop the buzzing. 4. Press “M” and “S” button simultanely, it will clear the memory and turn back to zero.  5. When it shows 00:00, press the “ST/SP” button directly, it will just count up until you stop it. IMPORTANT NOTICE The timer will not shut off automatically if you start countup, it will work until no battery , and the battery will drain very fast . So please press stop button when you finished countup function. then the timer will shut off automatically 10 minutes later.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61f39sRnvoL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GTDnow","source_asin":"B074T5724B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-627546","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074T5724B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074T5724B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
