window.products.push({"id":627556,"name":"TBF Mini Canvas Reusable Gift Tote Bags w/Clear Front Pocket for Wedding Favors, Crafts, Decorations (10x8x5)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61k6bPHeabL._AC_UL1024_.jpg","description":"This fully customizable cotton canvas gift tote bags are made from 100% cotton fabric which is strong and durable, and they are made to last years of use with its reinforced stress points. The mini canvas tote bag has a full gusset to increase capacity of the bag. The 14\" soft cotton fabric handles are thick for added durability. It has 4\" x 5\" clear plastic pocket to showcase cards or name tags as wedding welcome or gift bags. The plastic pocket is securely stitched on the canvas bag. With one open side, easily insert photos, name cards or paper art. This rustic chic canvas tote bags great for rustic vintage looking wedding, bridesmaid gifts, Christmas gifts and favors for your party, guests or celebrations. These sturdy canvas bags are ideal for promotional uses, giveaways, trade show, arts & crafts, decorations, DIY, fundraising needs. It has a 8\"W x 6\"H imprint area on the back as well for your logo, slogan, event, date or other information to be silkscreen printed, embroidered on.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61k6bPHeabL._AC_UL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TBF","source_asin":"B09B8WV3DJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-627556","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B8WV3DJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B8WV3DJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":627557,"name":"C&K Solutions Folding Hand Fan Chinese Gifts Plum Blooming and Bamboo Large Premium Quality Handheld Japanese Fans","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IA4K5bwqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Finally an Asian Folding Fan Gift Than You (And Your Friends) Will Love! The set includes one premium quality handmade hand-drawn silk and bamboo folding fan authentically Made in China. Also included is a matched carrying sleeve that is custom built specifically for these fans (about 13\" long when closed). The sleeve protects the fans extremely well allowing for simple traveling options to keep the fan with you on the go. Beautiful Lush Plum Blossoms Growing with Bamboo! This scene shows a painting of blossoming plum flowers blooming and competing with the surrounding bamboo. On the reverse side are two lovely poems by Li Bai from the Tang Dynasty. The first describes a trip down Mt Emei on a boat at night. The second is another poem about traveling down a river in a small boat through the mountains leaving Baidi City. Full translations in the emails after purchasing. It really is quite the story and the perfect trivia to go with this gift. Want to Show Off Your New Fan to the World? No problem! We have you covered! Click on the C&K Solutions brand or store name above (near the title) to find our selection of related gift sets and fan stands. There are several options and price ranges to fit your budget! Be sure to check the special offers sections also for discounts! Need More Reasons??? How about Instant Savings in Your Wallet?! Purchasing these items together allows you convenience, simplicity and savings! You won't be able to find this anywhere else. Buy now and Save! No Risk! No Hassle! Buy Now With Confidence! We at C&K Solutions are so confident in our products that we know you will love them too. If you have any issues contact our office with any concerns and we will be happy to help you and make you whole. What are you waiting for? Click the Add to Cart Button!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IA4K5bwqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"C&K Solutions","source_asin":"B07QD7HF7B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-627557","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QD7HF7B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QD7HF7B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
