window.products.push({"id":627611,"name":"WELTRXE EVA Shower Curtain Liner Waterproof, Clear 8G Heavy Duty Plastic Shower Curtain Liner with Magnets for Bathroom Shower Stall, Bathtubs, Thick ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8164jT6EiTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our shower curtain liner is made of heavy weighted material, you don't need to worry about float up and stick to you while you're taking a shower, it stays in place. Keep your bathroom environment safe, clean, and fresh every time you shower. The magnets have weight and stick well to the bath. This waterproof bathroom shower curtain liner has a weighted bottom and a buttonhole top and is a perfect fit for most standard-sized tubs. Heavy Duty: 8 gauge/0.2mm thick shower curtain liner is durable and soft, not too stiff, it has enough weight on its own to maintain its position and not be moved by drafts, thicker than other 0.15mm's shower liners. Weighted Bottom: Has a weighted bottom that will keep water in the tub and help you avoid a slippery mess on your floor. Reinforced button-holes and a weighted hem finish off this perfect fit for your bathtub or shower. Use as a Liner or Alone: Water glides off and the curtain dries quickly. It can be used by itself or as a liner to protect your decorative shower curtain. Easy to Install: Equipped with a reinforced metal grommet and 12pcs plastic hanging hooks for easy setup and ready to use quickly. Feature: EVA, non-toxic and odorless; 12 rust-proof metal grommets, 3 magnets at the bottom Reinforced hanging holes 100% waterproof, easy to maintain Great quality, looks and works great Product Dimensions: 72 x 72 inch/(183x183cm), 8 gauge/0.2mm thick Package Include: 1 pcs Shower Curtain Liner 12 pcs Extra Plastic Hooks Note: A steel tube is not included","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8164jT6EiTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WELTRXE","source_asin":"B08C4XK89V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-627611","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C4XK89V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C4XK89V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
