window.products.push({"id":627676,"name":"Safe2m Coffee Mug Warmer, Electric Warmer with Auto Shut Off and Timing, 2 Temperature Setting Smart Cup for Warming & Heating Beverage Milk Tea Desk ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51f0eMI9K0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❣2021 New Design Smart Beverage Warmer Give you a better lifestyle!❣It is medically proved that drinking water coffee beverages at appropriate warm temperature is good for health.Keep Your Drinks Warm Anytime You Want: Perfect for coffee, tea, hot cocoa, soup, solid oil, liquid, baby food more (45℃ is best for drink ).This can also be used as candle wax warmer plate.This coffee mug warmer is convenient and portable, It is a great gift your families, lover or friends on Valentine's day, Thanksgiving, Christmas or other special occasions.Specification༆Power: 18W༆Mode: Standby - Lights flashing, high temperature mode - red light, low temperature mode - blue light✐✐Precautions:1.When not in use for a long time, please Remove the plug or turn off the power.2.The insulation effect of different cups is not the same, the steel cup is the best, the glass is the second, the plastic cup is the worst;The cover can be covered when it is kept warm, and the effect is the best.3.The heater is very hot during work, please don't touch it. Do not let children or pets come into contact with it to avoid burns.4.The insulation seat intelligent to play the role of insulation, and can not boil water. Only keep the temperature of the water between 40-60 °C.5.The tempered glass panel is waterproof, but please do not put the insulation in the water for cleaning.6.After use, the temperature of the heating plate is still very high, so do not touch it in a short time.7. It can be used as a baby bottle warmer to maintain the best taste for the baby anytime.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51f0eMI9K0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Safe2m","source_asin":"B09FF3H8J8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-627676","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FF3H8J8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FF3H8J8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
