window.products.push({"id":627715,"name":"Tempcore Flannel Fleece Blanket Queen Size Yellow,Super Soft Cozy Luxury Bed Blanket, Microfiber Blanket for Bed Couch Chair,Yellow Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91mRZZ9gunL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SKIN-FRIENDLY MATERIAL: High-quality 260 GSM microfiber blanket, all layers to last for long use and provides fade resist and stain better than others like blanket cotton - Blanket microfiber is NOT tend to bunch with time like cotton which has little elasticity to keep its shape for long - Save your time with quick drying and wrinkle resistant soft blanket microfiber. UNIQUE DESIGN PHILOSOPHY: Our fleece blanket brings you more breathable and lightweight feeling than regular cotton blanket throw to keep your body warm - Neat stitches enhance strong connections at seams and better structural strength with integrated outlook - Double-side reversible design offers you different senses of softness to improve your sleep with one side of smooth and fuzzy to the other. VERSATILE USAGE SCENARIOS: Enjoy your family happy hours with warm flannel fleece blankets while snuggling and watching your favorite TV shows on the couch - Bring extra soft and comfort for an afternoon nap in bed covering with our fleece blanket - Perfect for indoor and outdoor use to provide continuous warmth in chilly weather, especially for camping and picnic. SIZE AND COLOUR: Available in Flannel Fleece Blanket Twin 60\" x 80\", Blanket Throw Size 50\" x 60\", Queen Size Blanket 90\" x 90\", King Flannel Fleece Blanket 108\" x 90\" . Plus, we offer our throw blankets in different colors, Variety of color selections to decor: Grey, Navy,White, Ash Black,Burgundy,so you’ll be sure to find one to match your style. Add extra texture to your decor and turn your room into an inviting space with this simple, yet classy and elegant design! 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED:We love our customers and take pride in providing a pleasant shopping experience. Please keep in mind, it usually takes about a week to get used to the blanket’s weight. If for any reason you’re unhappy with your purchase, we offer a full refund— no questions asked! We’re available to answer your questions, 24/7, and are always happy to hear from you, so please don’t hesitate to get in touch with us!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91mRZZ9gunL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tempcore","source_asin":"B07T7149YZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-627715","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T7149YZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07T7149YZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
