window.products.push({"id":627846,"name":"Collections Etc Fall Leaves Accented Printed Throw Rug, Home Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+X8VSt-kL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Fall Leaves Accented Printed Throw Rug, Home DecorDescriptionFeaturing beautiful fall leaves in shades of yellow, orange, burgundy and ivory atop a chocolate brown background, these rugs are the perfect way to add autumn color to your home. Perfect in high traffic areas or anywhere in your home, the accent rugs come in two different sizes and have skid-resistant backings. Spot clean. Nylon and latex; imported. Choose: 20\" x 30\" or 27\" x 45\".Material TypeLatex,NylonShop with confidence! For over 50 years, Collections Etc has been bringing unique, whimsical, inspirational, and home solution products to customers. All Collections Etc products come with a 60 day, easy return policy and 100% satisfaction guarantee.About Collections Etc’s Accent / Area RugsOur wide selection of floor mats includes great options for the whole house. From indoors to outdoors, our collection includes braided mats, cushion mats, coir bristle mats, hooked mats, and more!Our cushion and braided floor mats are perfect for the kitchen or laundry room. They offer comfort for your feet while cooking, washing dishes, or doing laundry. And with our wide variety of colors and designs, you’re sure to find one that would look great with your décor.No Risk Purchase, Hassle-Free Returns - 100% Satisfaction GuaranteedWith customer satisfaction as our number one priority, we proudly offer a Satisfaction Guarantee for all our merchandise and services. From our appealing merchandise and incredible values, to our friendly customer service, we strive to provide a positive shopping experience by meeting or exceding your expectations. If you are not completely satisfied within 60 days of your purchase (see return policy for details).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+X8VSt-kL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Collections Etc","source_asin":"B07FL35PD2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-627846","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FL35PD2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FL35PD2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":627847,"name":"Lara Cabana 100% Turkish Cotton Beach Towel Pool Spa Bath Extra Soft & Large (35\" x60) by Corner4Shop (Navy 2 Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FDGh0xzOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Brief Description: The towels that we use all over the world actually were first woven in modern day Bursa in the 18th century. Weavers invented different techniques for these towels and the towels known as `havly` at the beginning are now known as `havlu`, which is actually the Turkish word for towels. The specialty and much of the fame of these towels naturally rest on the fact that these towels were hand woven, which limited their manufacturing to 3-4 towels a day. *Package includes 1 Towel, Great for Beach, Pool, Bath, and Spa, Very absorbent and durable, Available in Black, Blue, Navy, Yellow, Green, and Pink Color, Cabana Striped Design. 1) Wash Your Towels Before You Use Them Wash your towels with a ½ cup of white vinegar before using them for the first time. The vinegar will help set the dyes and keep the colors more resilient. Plus, running the towels through a laundry cycle will reduce the shedding that can often be found in new towels. 2) Launder Your Towels Together If you don’t want your towels to pill, launder them only with other towels. What is a “pill”? It’s when short fabric fibers rub together with the long fibers of bath towels, causing them to bunch and create little nubs on the fabric, or “pills.” Over drying can also lead to pills, so keep an eye on your drying time. 3) Wash Towels in Small Laundry Loads Trying to wash and dry too many towels at once can damage your washing machine and interfere with your dryer’s ability to dry your towels properly. An overstuffed load of towels in your dryer won’t allow enough air circulation to fluff up the fibers. Instead, a too-full load will mat down fibers, causing your towels to come out stiff instead of soft. 4) Avoid Fabric Softener This may seem like a contradiction, but fabric softeners can actually damage your towels. Fabric softeners cause buildup and can mat your fibers down, which causes stiffness and a decrease in absorbency.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FDGh0xzOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Silken Textile","source_asin":"B072Y95R53","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-627847","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072Y95R53","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072Y95R53","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
