window.products.push({"id":627919,"name":"Onion Holder for Slicing, Stainless Steel Food Vegetable Slicer Assistant, Tomato Slicer Holder, Onion Cutter, Onion Chopper, Onion Slicer for Tomatoe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JJTK8IKxS._AC_.jpg","description":"Features: 2 for 1 slicer - Not only can this onion holder slicer fix vegetables and fruits such as onions, the needle is very strong, so it can also be used as tender meat needle to make your life easier. Multipurpose onion/tomato slicer - Not just for onions. These onion holder slicer can also be used for other hard ingredients, such as fruits, potatoes, carrots, lemons and even garlic. Vegetable clips can also be used as tender meat. The long steel needle penetrates deeply into the meat to improve its taste. It is also easy to clean and light weight after use. Size of onion holder - 5.1 x 3.7 inch, needle length of onion slicers: 2.8 inch, needle diameter of onion slicers: 0.06 inch. Onion Holder: Keep onions, potatoes, tomatoes and carrots sliced evenly. The sharp teeth are sharp enough to slide easily into hard vegetables such as onions, carrots or potatoes. Slice the blade between the fork teeth! It has super sharp stainless steel needle, just put the blade between the fork teeth and cut off! The onion rack can also help you remove any odor from your hands when you're finished - there's no onion on your hands anymore! Specification: Material: Stainless steel. Size:14 x 9.5cm / 5.5 x 3.7 inches Needle length: 2.8 inch Needle diameter: 0.06 inch Package Include: 1 x Onion Holder","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JJTK8IKxS._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ANHORTS","source_asin":"B091V1K1Q2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-627919","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091V1K1Q2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091V1K1Q2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":627920,"name":"Inhand Fleece Throw Blankets, Super Soft Flannel Cozy Blankets for Adults, Washable Lightweight Fuzzy Blanket for Couch Sofa Bed Office, King Size War","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71P8xIQ+62L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍂LINT-FREE DURABLE THROW BLANKET: Fleece blankets are made with 280 GSM of premium microfiber polyester. Our soft blanket will be thicker and warmer than other blankets. The thicker design not only improves the softness of the blanket, also reduces the possibility of lint, and there is no need to worry about the problem of pilling. Tightly stitching edges and strong seams make your warm blanket more durable than cheap sew blankets. Who won't like comfortable, soft & warm blankets? 🍂PRACTICAL & DECORATIVE BLANKETS: Our Plush blanket with jacquard weave leaves has a great balance in utility and decoration. You can use it as throw blankets for couch, bed, office while watching TV, or presents of lap blankets for elderly. The warm blanket is also a great choice for mothers to use as blankets for baby boys and girls. Besides, A soft pattern throw blanket that looks like herringbone on the surface is a graceful decorative accent for our room, adding liveness to your life. 🍂STANDARD SIZE&COLOR OPTIONS: The plush queen-size flannel blanket of 90” x 90” is big enough to fully cover a twin-sized bed or any couch sofa. Extra-large skin-friendly fabric throw blanket wraps the body, relieving your mind and body. You can still keep breathable and warm without feeling heavy. If you have babies or cute pets like dogs and cats. also like this soft and warm blanket. Blankets full size available in gray, pink, green, tone, and blue, choose which color you like. 🍂DIFFERENT COLORS UNDER LIGHT: We have fleece blankets in a variety of colors for you to choose from. The design available on both sides will make the color of the front and back a little different. The magic is that different ways of touching will also have color changes. At the same time, the colors displayed under different lights, display settings, or resolutions, will be slightly different. All of these will only increase his charm. 🍂MACHINE WASHABLE: Our fleece blanket is can be washable by machine. We recommend you cleaning lightweight blankets on a gentle cycle with cold water. This can make the blanket more durable. The connection at the seams of the fleece cloth has been improved, and the stronger structural strength makes our blankets not torn even after repeated washing, and there will be no fading, hair removal, pilling, etc. This is also due to our use of high-quality flannel fleece fabrics.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71P8xIQ+62L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"inhand","source_asin":"B09BJH67J1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-627920","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BJH67J1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BJH67J1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
