window.products.push({"id":627967,"name":"Non-stick Coating Stainless Steel Tea Coffee Kettle with Thermometer, Gooseneck Thin Spout for Pour Over Coffee Pot, 40oz/1.25L, Stovetop & Microwave ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b1M-2ZqIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description EQUIP YOUR INNER BARISTA with Wolltoll's Drip Kettle! We’re all about life improvement here at Wolltoll. We know that living the good life means enjoying the simple things, the good things like friends, family, and good  mountain music. It’s about appreciating the small moments, like savoring the hand-crafted cup of coffee you just made from freshly ground beans. Are you looking to enjoy the best hand-crafted cup of coffee? Pour Over is the hand craft process and the Pour Over Coffee Kettle is a key tool for developing mastery of the pour over coffee craft! Products information: Item Width:5.7\"  Item height:5.9\"  Item weight:0.97lb Packing Size: L11.4*W5.9*H6.3\" Volume: 1.25L Material :304 Stainless Steel non-stick coating Package included: 1× Pour Over Coffee Kettle Why you choose this Coffee Kettle? FEATURES AND BENEFITS:  ●Integrated Thermometer ●1.25 Liter Capacity ●Easy to Hold Handle ●Heat resistant and angled handle just right to avoid burnt fingers ●Stainless Steel 304 Construction ●Easy to clean ●Easy for draining and cleaning ●Precision Gooseneck Spout ●Pour smoothly and evenly, no splash ●Heat-Resistant Knob ●No need for a towel GET THE PERFECT TEMPERATURE Never scorch your coffee again! Water that too hot or too cold could ruin coffee beans. An easy to read integrated thermometer and reader on the lid allows you to monitoring the water temperature every time with ease.  QUALITY CONSTRUCTION Invest in a quality appliance that will fully and effectively function for many years. Our kettle is made with premium 18/8 stainless steel, making it durable and resistant to rust. A double layer of metal at the base makes it leak-free allowing you to use it with gas and electrical stovetops.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b1M-2ZqIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wolltoll","source_asin":"B08NJJ6JHY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-627967","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NJJ6JHY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NJJ6JHY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
